{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792646160, "covers_from": "2026-10-22T05:16:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-22T05:17:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792646220, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:16:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 54439, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "面對現在氣候變遷，出現急遽高溫，夏日柏油路非常燙看似快冒煙，在我小時侯會街頭會出現灑水車來降溫，希望", "display_name": "中正代表 林玉婷……佳鈞媽", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:16:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 62389, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "其他", "content": "我是個不會手語的聽障，整個生活從聽課、聊天，到出社會工作聆聽會議、聽主管交代事項，都有困難，怎麼改善", "display_name": "文山代表 No.62,389", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:16:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 26840, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "文化", "content": "台北驕傲不應該是101輝達大巨蛋，要從文化凝聚，國外成功慶典，都是全民共感齊動！台北呢？錢砸不出共鳴", "display_name": "中山代表 No.26,840", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-22T05:16:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2523, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "觀光", "content": "大稻埕很難找舒服的廁所，遊客中心6點關門(5點半就不讓人上去使用廁所)且永樂市場廁所老舊希望能改善", "display_name": "大同代表 No.2,523", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 62389, "sprite_key": "turtle_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.62,389", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 26840, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.26,840", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 2523, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.2,523", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 29099, "sprite_key": "deer_busi